{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0453_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3a899076c921893ec9fa86d8e12b5d3126c8b0d310e1b52a92add619b83ef95e", "ja": "（温泉旅館での朋花のライブは大成功だった。が……。\nまさかその後で、あんな事態が起きるとは……）", "zh": "（朋花在温泉旅馆举办的演出大获成功。然而……没想到之后竟然会发生那样的事……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0453_1001_031tom", "source_sha256": "5662a6239b0bdd58b44c0862b72cf32052c227780836290ec51827c43186b3aa", "ja": "うふふ、昨晩の{$P$}さんは、\n顔を真っ赤にして、情けない姿でしたね～。", "zh": "呵呵，昨晚的{$P$}先生，\n脸红得像熟透了一样，样子真是窝囊呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0453_1002_p", "source_sha256": "3df9cc0bd6cf588a0eb3913bdd41a6476f5d2fdb1d442b7d6d0132f858e43b25", "ja": "ああ、本当にすまなかった……。\nまさか朋花が入ってるなんて思わなくて。", "zh": "啊，真的很抱歉……\n没想到朋花会在里面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0453_1003_031tom", "source_sha256": "d579b92e8f29b53f8eace336d76c7817be741da83b9774588540dcbe73f220c3", "ja": "わかっていますよ～？　あれは単なる事故。\n{$P$}さんに非はありません～。", "zh": "我知道哦～？那只是一场意外。\n{$P$}先生没有错～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0453_1004_p", "source_sha256": "f01cc0f3756090dcf73b23fee902a429a8beac71538fd9f7b4d62899b4ea2f83", "ja": "そう言ってもらえると、心が軽くなるよ……。", "zh": "你这么说，我心里就轻松多了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0453_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "82c83e8173e1f8a5ad8562fc08d533349a8af67f2f31353c63442ade688818a5", "ja": "ふふっ。それで{$P$}さん、\n温泉はたっぷり堪能できましたか～？", "zh": "呵呵。话说回来，{$P$}先生，温泉泡得尽兴吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0453_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c42920c81353b21ca22503f569d0cec47a130dd24e4e76a1319f91e0a602e679", "ja": "もちろん！\n朝風呂も入ってたけど、気持ちよかったよ。", "zh": "当然啦！\n我还泡了早澡，感觉很舒服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0453_1007_031tom", "source_sha256": "6e7551e0248dff4a616c0662a9de432de0638cc717aa1bc5c139ec822ffa880e", "ja": "それならよかったです～。せっかく温泉にきたのに\nゆっくり寛げないのでは意味がありませんから。", "zh": "那就太好了～难得来泡温泉，要是不能悠闲地放松，那就没有意义了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0453_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "8f08d4f8faeed64f9ed4ea92e703d54d1ddad63726ec4a39c55d23a561e9fee5", "ja": "聖母に尽くすということは、\n命を削ってまで働き続けることではありません～。", "zh": "为圣母尽心尽力，\n并不是要拼上性命一直工作哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0453_1009_031tom", "source_sha256": "94be1f62475ee1c0023c1bdcaea7dd9be9a9a8ad393fe4c83340f4ef34213b9a", "ja": "盲目的な忠誠は素晴らしいですが……たまには、\n自分のことにも目を向けてあげてくださいね～。", "zh": "盲目的的忠诚固然值得称赞……不过，偶尔也请关注一下自己吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0453_1010_p", "source_sha256": "81f9ca3fe4959f628735450dc241c72d9a808b435b9e47325aef8cae6784239d", "ja": "耳の痛い話だな……。\nでも、心配してくれてありがとう。肝に銘じておくよ。", "zh": "这话听着真让人刺痛啊……\n不过，谢谢你为我担心。我会牢记在心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0453_1011_031tom", "source_sha256": "670b4d23d5bbf677efcdc21f4b1e8f69896dc92786e77bd065a725fbb71f339e", "ja": "うふふ♪　そうしてください～。\n本来ならば聖母の施しは、子豚ちゃん達のもの……。", "zh": "嘻嘻♪那就请这么做吧～  \n本来圣母的施舍，应该是给小猪猪们的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0453_1012_031tom", "source_sha256": "b4c99aefc119b5885c20ac3b3a01af7adcd60d83642b044943d6f887d6176629", "ja": "望外の栄誉に預かったのですから、\nこれからも聖母のために奉仕してくださいね～。", "zh": "既然您已承蒙圣母赐予这份意外的荣耀，\n今后也请继续为圣母效劳哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0453_1013_p", "source_sha256": "a99ee6e5ce16539c27925f73b79adf5bac4309831096f3f07e730601a12703bf", "ja": "ああ、わかった。\nそれじゃ早速……朋花に提案があるんだ。", "zh": "啊，我知道了。\n那么马上……我有个提案想和朋花商量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0453_1014_031tom", "source_sha256": "df2a10972bd1e633ce6f017b57cb9f7d51067e5a380737f87a8628a46f434ab3", "ja": "わざわざそんな風に言うなんて……\nよほどの内容なんでしょう。期待してしまいますね～。", "zh": "特意这么说……\n看来是相当了不起的提议呢。我都忍不住期待起来了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0453_1015_p", "source_sha256": "dac7b33253313053fba5ede8af79b1b72d65765533b3b3b5c5881d8a328371c3", "ja": "プ、プレッシャーが……。その、近くに老舗の扇子屋が\nあるらしい。よかったら、帰りに寄ってみないか？", "zh": "压、压力好大……那个，听说附近有一家老字号的扇子店。要是你愿意，回去的时候要不要顺便去看看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0453_1016_031tom", "source_sha256": "20775196cce9d025c161506e89cd7484f9ffb6638a951230cc83c657c1a04c09", "ja": "まあ、及第点ですね～。どんな扇子に出会えるのか……\nふふ♪　それでは、道案内をお願いします～。", "zh": "哎呀，算及格了吧～。会遇到什么样的折扇呢……\n呵呵♪　那么，就麻烦您带路了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
